<description>&lt;p&gt;Somali militants attacked an Ethiopian base, killing 43 soldiers, while Ethiopian forces engaged Eritrean-backed fighters in Gemalo near Badme and shelled Alamata, killing 14 civilians, according to Amnesty. Ethiopian Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed warned Eritrea to cease support for Ethiopia's enemies or face destruction, and reiterated Ethiopia will not invade Eritrea, while also reaffirming a commitment to Horn of Africa peace. Kenyan trucks were escorted across the volatile Moyale border and Ethiopian troops resumed flights to Aksum, as MPs raised alarms over civilian killings and displacement across Amhara, Oromia, Tigray and other regions. The conflict produced 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQb0NESnpHdm9EdW5UdlNyTGFQZkExMFdHYklPSWFXOFdjeTlaeFJFT2tpTTd0eFl1NWNOSFJGdUJtNk1qQ0NVd0JabVhKNHZUaDlsbHJlTlJOUTRnajQtbFFKaVBxT2FMZEJRUllWNGVZZTVRZ1BTSUpnTGpTdWVySVc4cVN4Vm44WW9yNWpKOFRLNEc3dVVSdkhoVzB0eGNZdWZxSHhLcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE94ZkowR2ZPYmJjNFhlQkRGNnpveHdjRThxTWU5RVk0LV9oSmFFZzFXNFRVcWpjZWtFVWFETVpLN041UXJKVGFwSUIwUDd2SXc5Q2stTHVEY0g5aUZ5V3U2LUhLV3o1VUtFN29xY1JxS2JUd0tJUU1yX2I4SQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borkena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxORGxaMXFSNHFIVGVyMnFHdlZTNjBqSkVFT01FYjc4OUtkRjlkUmt0eHMwMXBjZ0pDVW9waEp4VnZWS3A0S3JiTlg5SjRqTEVCNTY2aHN4YUNSRm1VYmlfRHlTSWNnUFJQVEZ0c3ptTkt5SzhnUHFRZS12WVRId0NXMElDeUMydDd2N3FkQ0M3N25GcVRpQW9kRlVWWXRoSWtCdGFfd3IzRWZ1a2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borkena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQanVuMnVYTk91TUNYV1RyTnUtNlFkWElULTl2bmtHZkxrT3d4b0Uy